    "detailed_description": "<strong>Try yourself as a grumpy grandpa who was sent to the store for bread.</strong><br><br><strong>Try on the role of a grumpy grandpa who was sent to the store for bread.</strong><br><br>Have a race playing as a grandpa! Throughout the entire journey, you will be constantly hampered by geese, electric scooters and your own health, which you need to monitor so that the race does not end too soon!<br><br><strong>But grandpa also has a couple of aces up his sleeve:</strong><br><br>\u2022 Thanks to the special pills that he takes, obstacles in grandpa's path disappear and then reappear.<br>\u2022 Having collected enough coins, grandpa will be able to buy himself an energy drink and super boots, which will increase his endurance, and even improve his physical characteristics!<br>\u2022 Vending machines are located here and there on the streets, where you can buy useful things.<br>\u2022 Advertising posters with memes to boost morale<br>\u2022 Grandpa appreciates street benches and can have a good rest on them<br><br>Yes, in our runner you can stop in the middle of the run to catch your breath, sit on a bench and even ride a few stops on the bus.<br><br><strong>Help Grandpa uncover the secrets of his past and come face to face with his greatest fear!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Try yourself as a grumpy grandpa who was sent to the store for bread.</strong><br><br><strong>Try on the role of a grumpy grandpa who was sent to the store for bread.</strong><br><br>Have a race playing as a grandpa! Throughout the entire journey, you will be constantly hampered by geese, electric scooters and your own health, which you need to monitor so that the race does not end too soon!<br><br><strong>But grandpa also has a couple of aces up his sleeve:</strong><br><br>\u2022 Thanks to the special pills that he takes, obstacles in grandpa's path disappear and then reappear.<br>\u2022 Having collected enough coins, grandpa will be able to buy himself an energy drink and super boots, which will increase his endurance, and even improve his physical characteristics!<br>\u2022 Vending machines are located here and there on the streets, where you can buy useful things.<br>\u2022 Advertising posters with memes to boost morale<br>\u2022 Grandpa appreciates street benches and can have a good rest on them<br><br>Yes, in our runner you can stop in the middle of the run to catch your breath, sit on a bench and even ride a few stops on the bus.<br><br><strong>Help Grandpa uncover the secrets of his past and come face to face with his greatest fear!</strong>",
    "short_description": "Who said that old age is no fun? Grandpa: Bread Adventure is a crazy reimagining of the runner genre. Run around the city, overcoming obstacles, dodging hated scooter riders and geese.",
